  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Zambia&apos;s Multi- Agency Approach to Fighting Corruption Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICAR is supporting the Zambia Anti-Corruption Commission (ACC) on high profile cases to investment financial crime, and to trace, seize and recover the proceeds of crime.  this support is primarily delivery delivered through case mentoring but is complimented by ICAR&apos;s training activities in financial investigations and asset recovery (FI/AR) and offshore structures and mutual legal assistance (MLA)</narrative>
  </description>
